{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34767","headline":"皮袭美见留小讌次韵 · 羊昭业","name":"皮袭美见留小讌次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泽国春来少遇晴，有花开日且飞觥。\n王戎似电休推病，周顗才醒衆却惊。\n芳景渐浓偏属酒，煖风初畅欲调莺。\n知君不肯然官烛，争得华筵彻夜明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊昭业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}